    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the tide wash you away\"... that's a heavy thing to say. you really think it's better to just stop fighting? it feels like every bit of energy i have left is just being used to keep my head above water, but there's nothing underneath me to stand on. are you saying it's actually okay to just give up? to just stop trying to keep it all together?",
